	\L_0758a:
	ZH 1:
	'This is a pretty roundabout way'
	R
	'of going about this... Now we'
	R
	'still have to attack Zeth.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'You were the King, you'
	R
	'could’ve just surrendered and'
	R
	'given Zeth to me.'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_075fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... It’s true that I would'
	R
	'have no objections about'
	R
	'giving Zeth to you.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'But even if I did, eventually it'
	R
	'would cause discord.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'The new world will be made from'
	R
	'destruction.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s not even mentioning the'
	R
	'crime of making and using that'
	R
	'abominable magic...'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'Zeth should be destroyed.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'Destroyed by a hero, for a new'
	R
	'world to be brought in upon'
	R
	'it...'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_0758a:
	ZH 1:
	'So that’s the idea...'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_075fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Indeed.'
	R
	'King Rance...'
	R
	'I leave Zeth to you.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'Thoroughly destroy them, then'
	R
	'add them to your followers...'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll fight in the front line if'
	R
	'you order it, as well.'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_0758a:
	ZH 1:
	'...Don’t pretend to be sick'
	R
	'and cut out.'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_075fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course... Aah, also, I'
	R
	'disabled the magic barrier'
	R
	'covering Zeth Palace.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'Zeth’s cornerstones are the four'
	R
	'towers.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'If you defeat the Four Lords'
	R
	'protecting them, Zeth should'
	R
	'accept surrender.'
	\L_076af:
	ZH 1:
	'Now, King Rance...'
	R
	'Let’s fight Zeth together to'
	R
	'destroy them.'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_075c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Gandhi bowed deeply and left'
	R
	'the audience room.'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_0765c:
	\L_0758a:
	ZH 1:
	'He’s a pretty weird king,'
	R
	'too...'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_0764e:
	\L_07616:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh...'
	R
	'Does that mean he’s aware that'
	R
	'he’s...?'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_0758a:
	ZH 1:
	'Maaariiis.'
	R
	'Were you just thinking'
	R
	'something?'
	\L_076af:
	\L_076a2:
	\L_075fa:
	ZH 1:
	'N-No...'
	\L_076af:
